    "title": "The Trip of a Lifetime - Gorham Troop 73 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gorham Times Staff ,\n12 hours ago Over the last year and a half, a crew from Gorham Boy Scout Troop 73 has been preparing for a 9-day backpacking trip at Philmont Scout Ranch in New Mexico. The crew recently completed its fourth prep hike in the Mahoosuc Range to prepare for this trip. The boys have been working out and preparing physically for this trip in order to tackle the 12,000-ft. peaks at Philmont. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
